   237→        created: 2026-03-03T04:39:13.036Z
   238→        description: The kspec npm package bundles the pre-built web UI static assets so the daemon can
   239→          serve the web UI when installed in any project, without requiring a local web UI build.
   240→          The build pipeline copies packages/web-ui/build to dist/web-ui/, and resolveWebUiPath
   241→          falls back to that location relative to the daemon module.
   242→        acceptance_criteria:
   243→          - id: ac-1
   244→            given: npm run build is executed
   245→            when: build completes
   246→            then: packages/web-ui/build output is copied to dist/web-ui/ in the package
   247→          - id: ac-2
   248→            given: kspec is installed in a project with no local web UI build
   249→            when: daemon starts and resolves web UI path
   250→            then: resolveWebUiPath returns the bundled dist/web-ui/ path relative to the daemon module location
   251→          - id: ac-3
   252→            given: kspec is installed as an npm package in a non-monorepo project
   253→            when: browser opens http://localhost:3456/
   254→            then: daemon serves the bundled web UI and returns HTTP 200 with HTML content
   255→          - id: ac-4
   256→            given: an explicit webUiDir option or WEB_UI_DIR env var or local packages/web-ui/build is present
   257→            when: daemon starts
   258→            then: the explicit or local path takes precedence over the bundled dist/web-ui/ fallback
   259→        status:
   260→          maturity: draft
