   308→    description: |
   309→      REST API contract for HTTP endpoints and WebSocket protocol for real-time communication.
   310→      All REST endpoints return JSON with consistent patterns. WebSocket uses topic-based pub/sub
   311→      with request_id correlation for command acknowledgment.
