   545→        when: AC row expands
   546→        then: shows full Given/When/Then text with test coverage indicator if available
   547→      - id: ac-16
   548→        given: user navigates to /inbox
   549→        when: inbox list displays
   550→        then: shows items ordered by created_at desc with text preview, tags, added_by
   551→      - id: ac-17
