  1106→    title: Task Board (Kanban)
  1107→    type: feature
  1108→    tags: []
  1109→    description: |
  1110→      Kanban-style task board with columns mapping to kspec task states.
  1111→      Active Fleet row shows currently running agent work with live output.
  1112→      Task cards show key metadata, clicking opens detail modal.
  1113→      Not drag-and-drop — tasks transition via agents/CLI.
  1114→    acceptance_criteria:
  1115→      - id: ac-1
  1116→        given: |
  1117→          Tasks in various states
  1118→        when: |
  1119→          The task board renders
  1120→        then: |
  1121→          Tasks are distributed into columns: Backlog (pending, manual_only/unassessed),
  1122→          Ready (pending, eligible), In Progress (in_progress, needs_work),
  1123→          Review (pending_review), Done (completed recent), with blocked and cancelled
  1124→          handled as sections/indicators
